  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4f57265f2d95884493f924517248368, type: 3}
  m_Name: TreeSitter 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeText
  paragraphs:
  - I tried once to go deeper into the bush, past this tree.
  - 'Found a nice outcrop. Then a field of yellow reeds with a good hill to look
    out on. '
  - 'I guess I got a bit to far out after that. Got lost in the forest for a little
    bit. Crossing over the same lake, back and forth.  '
  - Found the way back, evenutually. I appeared on the other end of the park on one
    of the trails. I guess I crossed further than I thought.
  - It gives you more of an appreciation of people in movies getting lost in the
    forest.
  - 'Like "yeah, now I get it". '
